<title>NEW ZEALAND: Wang NZ annual net profit falls 28.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Wang NZ annual net profit falls 28.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  2.54 vs 3.56</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  4.5 vs 7.5</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 14.9 vs 20.9</p>
<p>    Turnover				    73.8 vs 72.2</p>
<p>    Pretax profit				3.9 vs 5.3</p>
<p>    Tax					    1.4 vs 1.8</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	  17.3 vs 17.0</p>
<p>Dividend carries 2.216418 cts/share imputation credits.</p>
<p>Pay date Sept 27</p>
<p>Reg date Sept 13</p>
<p>    Ex div   Sept 16</p>
